1. Register User
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "portfolio_tester@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

2. Login User
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "portfolio_tester@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

3. Create Note (Protected)
POST http://localhost:5000/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "title": "Mastering Node.js & Prisma",
  "content": "Built with modular architecture and clean JWT middleware.",
  "tags": ["nodejs", "express", "prisma"]
}

4. Get User Notes (Protected)
GET http://localhost:5000/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}